{
  "bvid": "BV1JF411N716",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "9e43c9f1ccc5a2506e074197784ea275debb16dc32528ec579d26998ef36d2e4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 940,
      "end_ms": 2680,
      "text": "我们今天要来讲一个事儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 2680,
      "end_ms": 9040,
      "text": "就是最近甚嚣尘上的哎我都不想写这四个字"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 9919,
      "end_ms": 13860,
      "text": "甚嚣尘上的这个一个所谓的成语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 15659,
      "end_ms": 17040,
      "text": "他不是成语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 18539,
      "end_ms": 21229,
      "text": "这个口号它实际上是一个政治口号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 21229,
      "end_ms": 23740,
      "text": "它的历史呢只有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 27060,
      "end_ms": 33060,
      "text": "只有刚刚只有50 52年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 33060,
      "end_ms": 34350,
      "text": "52年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 34350,
      "end_ms": 35940,
      "text": "52年的历史"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 36820,
      "end_ms": 39980,
      "text": "52年多一个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 42860,
      "end_ms": 46190,
      "text": "13天他只有52年的历史"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 46190,
      "end_ms": 49040,
      "text": "这个成语所谓的这个成语实际上是口号了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 49040,
      "end_ms": 52839,
      "text": "它叫做装进自强"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 56680,
      "end_ms": 61590,
      "text": "他现在竟然他而且这个这个这个口号呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 61590,
      "end_ms": 65780,
      "text": "他在他在这个大陆的这个文学界"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 65780,
      "end_ms": 67220,
      "text": "大陆的这个文化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 67220,
      "end_ms": 68240,
      "text": "文学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 68240,
      "end_ms": 70070,
      "text": "文艺的这方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 70070,
      "end_ms": 72240,
      "text": "从来没没没没有被用过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 72260,
      "end_ms": 73760,
      "text": "从来没有被用过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 73760,
      "end_ms": 74300,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 77690,
      "end_ms": 83780,
      "text": "他是也就是说它是和我们的共同体是敌对立场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 83780,
      "end_ms": 84560,
      "text": "是敌对立场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 84560,
      "end_ms": 85820,
      "text": "那现在他甚嚣尘上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 85820,
      "end_ms": 88539,
      "text": "我觉得这个是一个非常糟糕的一个状况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 89620,
      "end_ms": 91080,
      "text": "非常糟糕的一个状况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 91080,
      "end_ms": 93210,
      "text": "这个词它有52年历史"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 93210,
      "end_ms": 98800,
      "text": "是因为呢1970年6月15日"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 100180,
      "end_ms": 102039,
      "text": "在那之前的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 103660,
      "end_ms": 105420,
      "text": "几个月啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 105420,
      "end_ms": 106399,
      "text": "尼克松"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 113900,
      "end_ms": 118430,
      "text": "对待我们的关系日渐缓和啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 118430,
      "end_ms": 120380,
      "text": "对待大陆的关系日渐缓和"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 123650,
      "end_ms": 128690,
      "text": "所以导致某人某个空一格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 128690,
      "end_ms": 132539,
      "text": "导致某人呢他的心情非常沮丧啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 136820,
      "end_ms": 139100,
      "text": "他就发表了一个文书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 139100,
      "end_ms": 140480,
      "text": "就尼尼克松了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 140480,
      "end_ms": 142370,
      "text": "缓和对我们的关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 142370,
      "end_ms": 144940,
      "text": "缓和对我们的关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 147760,
      "end_ms": 149760,
      "text": "导致一个家伙空一格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 149760,
      "end_ms": 154280,
      "text": "这个家伙晚上睡不着觉了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 155140,
      "end_ms": 160839,
      "text": "他就发表了一篇报告啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 167719,
      "end_ms": 170809,
      "text": "就是在1970年6月15日"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 170809,
      "end_ms": 176720,
      "text": "他做的叫做我们这个是当然是他们了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 176720,
      "end_ms": 177560,
      "text": "加引号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 177560,
      "end_ms": 180750,
      "text": "我作为一个元音轴加引号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 180750,
      "end_ms": 182670,
      "text": "我们国家加引号啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 182670,
      "end_ms": 192160,
      "text": "当然它是非法的的立场和加引号的国民的精神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 193020,
      "end_ms": 195320,
      "text": "在这一篇里面啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 195320,
      "end_ms": 197180,
      "text": "这位空一格的这光头呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 197180,
      "end_ms": 200080,
      "text": "它连夜炮制了一个用语"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 200160,
      "end_ms": 204880,
      "text": "用语就是这个装进自强处变不惊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 206959,
      "end_ms": 209469,
      "text": "啊因为他当时风雨飘摇了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 209469,
      "end_ms": 211869,
      "text": "要被他的大哥抛弃了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 211869,
      "end_ms": 213849,
      "text": "要被他的主人抛弃了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 213849,
      "end_ms": 215960,
      "text": "要被美帝国主义抛弃了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 219939,
      "end_ms": 225050,
      "text": "随后就是呃逐步逐步的啊对华关系缓和啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 225050,
      "end_ms": 226130,
      "text": "美华关系缓和"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 226130,
      "end_ms": 227700,
      "text": "最后跟我们建交了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 228300,
      "end_ms": 232700,
      "text": "这个口号呢它是由两部分编程的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 232700,
      "end_ms": 242180,
      "text": "一个是礼记表记里面的君子装进"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 243899,
      "end_ms": 247940,
      "text": "日墙安歇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 251459,
      "end_ms": 252800,
      "text": "偷是吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 252859,
      "end_ms": 256399,
      "text": "就是如果你是一个很稳重的一个状态啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 256399,
      "end_ms": 258079,
      "text": "一直前进的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 258079,
      "end_ms": 261060,
      "text": "或者说一直做事情非常谨慎而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 261060,
      "end_ms": 262560,
      "text": "以敬畏的一个状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 262560,
      "end_ms": 265170,
      "text": "你就会日渐强盛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 265170,
      "end_ms": 269099,
      "text": "但是如果你安安然懈怠的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 269099,
      "end_ms": 271559,
      "text": "你就会日渐啊就是衰败了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 271559,
      "end_ms": 273419,
      "text": "这个偷袭就是越来越不行了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 273419,
      "end_ms": 275400,
      "text": "越来越没用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 285420,
      "end_ms": 290220,
      "text": "那么这个自强呢哦我可能记错了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 290220,
      "end_ms": 291060,
      "text": "不是安息啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 291060,
      "end_ms": 292140,
      "text": "应该是安寺啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 294380,
      "end_ms": 296090,
      "text": "这个礼记我我记不太得"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 296090,
      "end_ms": 299630,
      "text": "安寺日偷这个四就是和这个蝎差不多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 299630,
      "end_ms": 301940,
      "text": "就是放肆不紧张啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 301940,
      "end_ms": 304630,
      "text": "安四日偷装进日墙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 304630,
      "end_ms": 306010,
      "text": "安四日偷"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 306010,
      "end_ms": 308950,
      "text": "他就说就相当于说你只要每天就是很努力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 308950,
      "end_ms": 310390,
      "text": "那你一天会比一天强"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 310390,
      "end_ms": 318320,
      "text": "你如果很就是玩就是懈怠的贪玩懈怠了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 318320,
      "end_ms": 319940,
      "text": "那一天会比一天弱嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 333540,
      "end_ms": 335300,
      "text": "字写的丑不管了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 339579,
      "end_ms": 341339,
      "text": "那么光头空一格呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 341339,
      "end_ms": 342629,
      "text": "他晚上睡不着觉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 342629,
      "end_ms": 348120,
      "text": "他就把这两个儒家典籍里面的给拼凑到一块去啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 348120,
      "end_ms": 349740,
      "text": "我不知道他演化是怎么回事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 349740,
      "end_ms": 352740,
      "text": "就把这个日子可能看到这个这个自制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 353140,
      "end_ms": 355060,
      "text": "他可能留给他的日子不多了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 355060,
      "end_ms": 356650,
      "text": "他把这两个看混了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 356650,
      "end_ms": 358840,
      "text": "就搞出的那个装进自强"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 358840,
      "end_ms": 360600,
      "text": "装进自强呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 369770,
      "end_ms": 371420,
      "text": "美国人把他抛弃了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 371420,
      "end_ms": 373490,
      "text": "他就一直把这个装进自强"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 373490,
      "end_ms": 374810,
      "text": "用来自我安慰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 374810,
      "end_ms": 380260,
      "text": "用来对于他的呃人民进行这个洗脑灌输"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 382060,
      "end_ms": 384140,
      "text": "啊一直到这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 387560,
      "end_ms": 390240,
      "text": "2758号决议啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 390460,
      "end_ms": 393040,
      "text": "联合国2758号决议"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 393040,
      "end_ms": 400140,
      "text": "全面承认我们对于这个中国的在联合国的代表代表地位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 401660,
      "end_ms": 408340,
      "text": "这个空一格呢他在第2年1971年的10月26日"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 410120,
      "end_ms": 413200,
      "text": "他又发布了一个搞了一个幺蛾子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 413200,
      "end_ms": 416300,
      "text": "发布了一个叫他的所谓的告"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 416479,
      "end_ms": 417829,
      "text": "都加引号啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 427040,
      "end_ms": 428560,
      "text": "发表这东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 428560,
      "end_ms": 432910,
      "text": "这里面同样他进一步强调了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 432910,
      "end_ms": 434230,
      "text": "风雨飘摇的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 434230,
      "end_ms": 437650,
      "text": "他强调了要装进自强处变不惊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 437650,
      "end_ms": 439880,
      "text": "装进自强处变不惊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 441280,
      "end_ms": 443250,
      "text": "然后我们说这是空一格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 443250,
      "end_ms": 445260,
      "text": "空一格之后的那个家伙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 452259,
      "end_ms": 455780,
      "text": "他是把我们我们继续说吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 458420,
      "end_ms": 460100,
      "text": "他们在开会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 460200,
      "end_ms": 464700,
      "text": "反正只要扯到他的这个他们的那个什么什么主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 464700,
      "end_ms": 467060,
      "text": "一个数字啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 467060,
      "end_ms": 469540,
      "text": "加一个什么什么的主意啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 470420,
      "end_ms": 471700,
      "text": "三是什么什么主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 471700,
      "end_ms": 475760,
      "text": "它前面的这个定语啊都要加上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 493320,
      "end_ms": 497780,
      "text": "我就不不把它全部的那个前面定语都念出来了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 499580,
      "end_ms": 501500,
      "text": "只是没有什么太大的意思啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 501500,
      "end_ms": 504560,
      "text": "不把前面定语什么忠孝节义什么类似的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 504560,
      "end_ms": 506060,
      "text": "好像都是儒家色彩的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 506060,
      "end_ms": 507050,
      "text": "很糟糕的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 507050,
      "end_ms": 508010,
      "text": "一个儒家色彩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 508010,
      "end_ms": 513169,
      "text": "那么最后这个这个y的定语的最后一个就是这个装进自强"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 513169,
      "end_ms": 515719,
      "text": "他是非常明显的一个政治口号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 515719,
      "end_ms": 519109,
      "text": "而且是是这个这个非法小潮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 526260,
      "end_ms": 527250,
      "text": "这个词儿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 527250,
      "end_ms": 534260,
      "text": "它在我们大陆的文化文学没有流传过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 534840,
      "end_ms": 536300,
      "text": "只有很零星的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 536300,
